<%- include('../partials/app-start') %>
<div class="page-head"><h1>API documentation</h1><span class="muted">REST · JSON · v1</span></div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Authentication</h3>
<p>Send your API key in the <code>X-API-Key</code> header. Create keys in <a href="/portal/settings#api">Settings</a>. Limit: 120 requests/minute per IP.</p>
<pre>curl <%= baseUrl %>/api/v1/certificates -H "X-API-Key: liv_xxxxxxxx_..."</pre>

<h3 class="mt">Issue certificates</h3>
<p><code>POST /api/v1/certificates</code>. Send a single object, an array, or <code>{ "template_id", "certificates": [...] }</code> (max 500). All rows are validated first; if any row fails, nothing is issued (HTTP 422). Send an <code>Idempotency-Key</code> header to make retries safe.</p>
<pre>curl -X POST <%= baseUrl %>/api/v1/certificates \
  -H "X-API-Key: $LIV_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Idempotency-Key: lms-run-2026-10-04-001" \
  -d '{
    "template_id": "<%= templates[0] ? templates[0].id : 'TEMPLATE_ID' %>",
    "certificates": [{
      "first_name": "Jane", "last_name": "Doe", "email": "jane@example.com",
      "course_name": "Fire Safety &amp; Emergency Response",
      "completion_date": "2026-09-30"
    }]
  }'</pre>
<p>Response <code>201</code>: <code>{ batch_id, certificates: [{ cert_number, verify_url, pdf_url, ... }] }</code>.</p>
<p>Your template IDs: <% templates.forEach(t => { %><br><code><%= t.id %></code> (<%= t.name %>)<% }) %></p>

<h3 class="mt">Retrieve</h3>
<pre>GET /api/v1/certificates?limit=50&amp;offset=0
GET /api/v1/certificates/{cert_number}</pre>

<h3 class="mt">Revoke</h3>
<pre>POST /api/v1/certificates/{cert_number}/revoke
{ "reason": "Issued in error" }</pre>

<h3 class="mt">Public verification (no key)</h3>
<pre>GET /api/v1/verify/{cert_number}
→ { "result": "valid" | "revoked" | "tampered" | "not_found", "certificate": { ... } }</pre>

<h3 class="mt">Errors</h3>
<p><code>400</code> bad request · <code>401</code> missing/invalid key · <code>403</code> platform not active · <code>404</code> not found · <code>409</code> duplicate · <code>422</code> validation failed · <code>429</code> rate limited</p>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/app-end') %>
